*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0032
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-01-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 487
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0032.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FRD0032C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==AC==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 RISK-LVL           PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    *> FRAUD RISK SCORE
    05 RISK-SCORE         PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM SCORE-VELOCITY
    DISPLAY "RISK-LVL=" RISK-LVL
    DISPLAY "RISK-SCORE=" RISK-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
SCORE-VELOCITY.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> VERY HIGH TRANSACTION VELOCITY
        WHEN AC-TRAN-CNT-DAY > 25 AND AC-TXN-AMOUNT > 4000
            MOVE 'H' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 90 TO RISK-SCORE
        *> ELEVATED TRANSACTION VELOCITY
        WHEN AC-TRAN-CNT-DAY > 12
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 60 TO RISK-SCORE
        WHEN AC-ACCT-AGE-DAYS < 90
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 40 TO RISK-SCORE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'L' TO RISK-LVL
            MOVE 10 TO RISK-SCORE
    END-EVALUATE.
